{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dfa4dece6e089c7bd7fccd9aaa6ec74a51eb8c3f01647e75740470aa4a262536", "ja": "（今日の撮影のテーマは、ガーリー・ホワイトデー。\nそろそろ始まる時間だけど、歩の様子は……）", "zh": "（今天拍摄的主题是少女风白色情人节。马上就要到开始的时间了，步现在怎么样了呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "08f1207321ee3cb4f6c60fca6733e1d291ffc1a22ed7fc07e9f76c07f6d95044", "ja": "ふふっ……♪　うーん、なんか違うな。\nイェーイ！　……はもっとダメだし。うーん。", "zh": "呵呵……♪　嗯——总觉得不太对。\n“耶——！”……就更不行了。嗯——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2e1c3e1a07e5a7e862f074e567acf8e6ff18ca46949221333658066c5ec5aee0", "ja": "お疲れさま、歩。何してるんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，步。你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c0ce33d55d03dad73f928ab04b4a4d20f9780fff157d9806b0d1867ce029e33d", "ja": "ああ、{$P$}。……そうだ。\n{$P$}に教えてもらおうかな？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。……对了。\n要不要请教一下{$P$}呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "11709b697572a60740880b669b46948960f82ab5a3f2566655f195eb5b37b6d7", "ja": "あのさ。その……か、可愛い笑顔、って\nどうやって作ればいいと思う！？", "zh": "那个……就是……你觉得，怎、怎样才能露出可爱的笑容呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ddb47f69f563135416e8b46e7c8a5a08f471544307c93e1b74f232ea00d759fd", "ja": "可愛い笑顔？", "zh": "可爱的笑容？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "49b82bb9e07ca1127a511161e3741844d28470741c6b83fc12185c8cbbcb2eb9", "ja": "さっき、監督に言われたんだ。このあと撮るシーンは、\n自然で可愛い笑顔がすっ……ごく重要なんだ！って。", "zh": "刚才导演跟我说，接下来要拍的场景里，自然又可爱的笑容是——非常重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "41ad6896258e094da5c84c63122130052c3e33baae91ebe52ba50f6fbb7dd5c6", "ja": "でも、自然で可愛い笑顔って言われても、\nそれってどんな笑顔なのさ～！　……って悩んでて。", "zh": "可是，光说自然又可爱的笑容，谁知道那到底是什么样的笑容啊～！我正为这事烦恼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1008_p", "source_sha256": "62623d0b8bd61a826fcce514bcb7fc234d0b693657bef3d843a693336eedb8cf", "ja": "自然で可愛い笑顔か……。今日の歩の雰囲気なら、\n何もしなくても自然で可愛い笑顔になりそうだけどな。", "zh": "自然又可爱的笑容吗……以今天步的状态，就算什么都不做，也应该能笑得自然又可爱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f79b267e7fe86abd37e96cc4f9ce3dfe8eab4c92aeff609f93973fa27befb3de", "ja": "アタシもそう思ったんだけど。意識しちゃったせいか、\nどんどん、ぎこちなくなってきてる気がして……。", "zh": "我也是这么想的。可可能是因为太在意了，感觉笑容变得越来越不自然了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3cdd4a055243d027d090d4f8d975f411cf695f8935439c78feae367175305c54", "ja": "なるほど。……歩の可愛い笑顔なら、\nつい最近、見た記憶があるよ。", "zh": "原来如此。……步那可爱的笑容，我记得最近刚见过一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "97d14e2383d1cca61c23b92102ccd84b0d4688e81dbfc779a87eeb320844dd4b", "ja": "ホント？　それいつ、どんなとき！？\n思い出せれば、再現できるかも！", "zh": "真的？什么时候，什么情况下！？\n要是能想起来，说不定就能重现出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f3d7fae0287f704485ab1845094ffca2552ce47fca49d62bd8fdc007669bd4f7", "ja": "ほら、この前、ロケの下見を兼ねて\n歩と出かけた時……。", "zh": "你看，就是之前为了踩点，和步一起出门的时候……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ba85bd04d0aff9037eb4429f4b2ed2e8f5a6e5152fc14044c4a58d132960fe21", "ja": "あっ！　あの、デー……じゃなくて、出かけたとき！？\nでもアタシ、そんな顔したコトあったかな……。", "zh": "啊！那个，约……不对，是出去玩的时候！？  \n可是，我有露出过那样的表情吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1014_p", "source_sha256": "43f73e59b5598aec7c977520ab7e55474b95ecec8bf546da1916cb138353c88a", "ja": "そうだな。歩は特に意識してたわけじゃないんだろう\nけど……でも、自然で可愛い笑顔だったよ。", "zh": "是啊。步应该也不是特别在意吧，不过……那是很自然、很可爱的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "16a5845ff1579b664ca230ca1282cbe327181243dd892e888cd9d4a0f4a1aaf7", "ja": "も……もー！　だから{$P$}は、\nなんでそういうコト言うんだよ～！", "zh": "真是……真是的！所以说{$P$}，\n干嘛要说这种话啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6aba6d11d6021d829a53c281dcfa4d9f80277ba6ec62d4d7458cba4f5b1a78c6", "ja": "うう、ダメだ。ますます意識して、\n笑顔が作れなくなっちゃう～！　マイガー！", "zh": "呜呜，不行了。越来越在意，反而越来越做不出笑容了～！天哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0304_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5be9f145e4ba579287d6e7a865a3438040b9afd9f882c1da110f9c4e32a9775e", "ja": "あ、歩！　落ち着くんだ……！", "zh": "啊、步！冷静点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
